    <string name="device_scan_advice">Uninstall opens the system confirmation screen; the app is never removed silently. If you suspect stalkerware, change your passwords from another device.</string>
    <string name="device_scan_rationale_title">Why does X-Security read your app list?</string>
    <string name="device_scan_rationale_body">To scan installed apps, X-Security lists every package on this device (QUERY_ALL_PACKAGES) and reads its APK file. The list and results stay on this device; nothing is uploaded. Stalkerware hides under innocent names, so the scan cannot rely on a fixed list of packages.</string>
